{"id":"45acd372bb8b9947","group":"68","path":"68/68-df-real-machine.md","title":"Machines with Read Only Real Registers","display":"df-real-machine — Machines with Read Only Real Registers","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)","book_abbrev":"68","label":"68-df-real-machine","aliases":["68-df-real-machine"],"display":"df-real-machine — Machines with Read Only Real Registers","depends_on":["[[68-df-baire-space]]","[[68-df-basic-machine]]","[[68-df-basic-machine-computation]]"],"source_edition":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF","source_location":"§18 pp.68–69 / PDF 77–78","verification_status":"source-adapted-definition","source_proof_status":"construction-reviewed"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"68"},{"key":"label","html":"68-df-real-machine"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>68-df-real-machine</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-real-machine — Machines with Read Only Real Registers"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4bd688e6777d088c\" href=\"?note=4bd688e6777d088c\" title=\"68-df-baire-space\">68-df-baire-space</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"87b1d4bf7c9d6143\" href=\"?note=87b1d4bf7c9d6143\" title=\"68-df-basic-machine\">68-df-basic-machine</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"89e092f6450e5227\" href=\"?note=89e092f6450e5227\" title=\"68-df-basic-machine-computation\">68-df-basic-machine-computation</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§18 pp.68–69 / PDF 77–78"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-adapted-definition"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"construction-reviewed"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m,k\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(m,k\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec\\alpha\\in\\mathcal B^m\">\\(\\vec\\alpha\\in\\mathcal B^m\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^k\">\\(\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^k\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal I,\\mathcal R\">\\(\\mathcal I,\\mathcal R\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"87b1d4bf7c9d6143\" href=\"?note=87b1d4bf7c9d6143\" title=\"68-df-basic-machine\">68-df-basic-machine</a>。初态 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho_{k,\\vec x}\">\\(\\rho_{k,\\vec x}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"89e092f6450e5227\" href=\"?note=89e092f6450e5227\" title=\"68-df-basic-machine-computation\">68-df-basic-machine-computation</a>，将该处 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x_1,\\ldots,x_k\">\\(x_1,\\ldots,x_k\\)</span> 依次取为本处 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x_0,\\ldots,x_{k-1}\">\\(x_0,\\ldots,x_{k-1}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span> 是下式定义的程序，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q,t\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(q,t\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho\\in\\mathcal R\">\\(\\rho\\in\\mathcal R\\)</span>。实寄存器编号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\">\\(r\\)</span> 从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span> 开始；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho[i\\leftarrow v]\">\\(\\rho[i\\leftarrow v]\\)</span> 为单点更新。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal I_m^{\\mathcal B}:=\\mathcal I\\cup\\{(3,r,i,j):r&lt;m\\land i,j\\in\\mathbb N\\land i\\ne j\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal I_m^{\\mathcal B}:=\\mathcal I\\cup\\{(3,r,i,j):r&lt;m\\land i,j\\in\\mathbb N\\land i\\ne j\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P_m^{\\mathcal B}:=\\{P\\in(\\mathcal I_m^{\\mathcal B})^{&lt;\\omega}:\\forall q&lt;\\operatorname{lh}(P)\\;\\forall i,n\\in\\mathbb N\\;((P(q)=(1,i,n)\\lor P(q)=(2,n))\\Rightarrow n&lt;\\operatorname{lh}(P))\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal P_m^{\\mathcal B}:=\\{P\\in(\\mathcal I_m^{\\mathcal B})^{&lt;\\omega}:\\forall q&lt;\\operatorname{lh}(P)\\;\\forall i,n\\in\\mathbb N\\;((P(q)=(1,i,n)\\lor P(q)=(2,n))\\Rightarrow n&lt;\\operatorname{lh}(P))\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\delta_{P,\\vec\\alpha}^{\\mathcal B}(q,\\rho):=\\begin{cases}\n(q,\\rho)&amp;q\\ge\\operatorname{lh}(P),\\\\\n(q+1,\\rho[i\\leftarrow\\rho(i)+1])&amp;q&lt;\\operatorname{lh}(P)\\land P(q)=(0,i),\\\\\n(n,\\rho[i\\leftarrow\\rho(i)-1])&amp;q&lt;\\operatorname{lh}(P)\\land P(q)=(1,i,n)\\land\\rho(i)&gt;0,\\\\\n(q+1,\\rho)&amp;q&lt;\\operatorname{lh}(P)\\land P(q)=(1,i,n)\\land\\rho(i)=0,\\\\\n(n,\\rho)&amp;q&lt;\\operatorname{lh}(P)\\land P(q)=(2,n),\\\\\n(q+1,\\rho[j\\leftarrow\\alpha_r(\\rho(i))])&amp;q&lt;\\operatorname{lh}(P)\\land P(q)=(3,r,i,j).\n\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\delta_{P,\\vec\\alpha}^{\\mathcal B}(q,\\rho):=\\begin{cases}\n(q,\\rho)&amp;q\\ge\\operatorname{lh}(P),\\\\\n(q+1,\\rho[i\\leftarrow\\rho(i)+1])&amp;q&lt;\\operatorname{lh}(P)\\land P(q)=(0,i),\\\\\n(n,\\rho[i\\leftarrow\\rho(i)-1])&amp;q&lt;\\operatorname{lh}(P)\\land P(q)=(1,i,n)\\land\\rho(i)&gt;0,\\\\\n(q+1,\\rho)&amp;q&lt;\\operatorname{lh}(P)\\land P(q)=(1,i,n)\\land\\rho(i)=0,\\\\\n(n,\\rho)&amp;q&lt;\\operatorname{lh}(P)\\land P(q)=(2,n),\\\\\n(q+1,\\rho[j\\leftarrow\\alpha_r(\\rho(i))])&amp;q&lt;\\operatorname{lh}(P)\\land P(q)=(3,r,i,j).\n\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"C^{\\mathcal B}(P,k,\\vec\\alpha,\\vec x,0):=(0,\\rho_{k,\\vec x}),\\qquad C^{\\mathcal B}(P,k,\\vec\\alpha,\\vec x,t+1):=\\delta_{P,\\vec\\alpha}^{\\mathcal B}(C^{\\mathcal B}(P,k,\\vec\\alpha,\\vec x,t)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[C^{\\mathcal B}(P,k,\\vec\\alpha,\\vec x,0):=(0,\\rho_{k,\\vec x}),\\qquad C^{\\mathcal B}(P,k,\\vec\\alpha,\\vec x,t+1):=\\delta_{P,\\vec\\alpha}^{\\mathcal B}(C^{\\mathcal B}(P,k,\\vec\\alpha,\\vec x,t)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对应 §18，印刷 pp.68–69 / PDF pp.77–78。原书实寄存器从 1 编号且把读取指令编码为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle3,i,j,r\\rangle\">\\(\\langle3,i,j,r\\rangle\\)</span>；本节点采用从 0 编号的结构元组 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(3,r,i,j)\">\\((3,r,i,j)\\)</span>，尚未引入数值 Gödel 编码，不能把这两个编码字面认同。读取指令只改写数寄存器，实输入在整个运行中固定。六个分支穷尽且互斥；实函数全性和数寄存器有限支撑性保证一步转换为全函数，自然数递归给出唯一运行。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m=0\">\\(m=0\\)</span> 时退化为基本机器。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"68-df-baire-space","status":"resolved","id":"4bd688e6777d088c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-baire-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-basic-machine","status":"resolved","id":"87b1d4bf7c9d6143","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-basic-machine]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-basic-machine-computation","status":"resolved","id":"89e092f6450e5227","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-basic-machine-computation]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-basic-machine","status":"resolved","id":"87b1d4bf7c9d6143","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$m,k\\in\\mathbb N$，$\\vec\\alpha\\in\\mathcal B^m$，$\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^k$。$\\mathcal I,\\mathcal R$ 见 [[68-df-basic-machine]]。初态 $\\rho_{k,\\vec x}$ 见 [[68-df-basic-machine-computation]]，将该处 $x_1,\\ldots,x_k$ 依次取为本处 $x_0,\\ldots,x_{k-1}$。$P$ 是下式定义的程序，$q,t\\in\\mathbb N$，$\\rho\\in\\mathcal R$。实寄存器编号 $r$ 从 $0$ 开始；$\\rho[i\\leftarrow v]$ 为单点更新。","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-basic-machine-computation","status":"resolved","id":"89e092f6450e5227","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$m,k\\in\\mathbb N$，$\\vec\\alpha\\in\\mathcal B^m$，$\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^k$。$\\mathcal I,\\mathcal R$ 见 [[68-df-basic-machine]]。初态 $\\rho_{k,\\vec x}$ 见 [[68-df-basic-machine-computation]]，将该处 $x_1,\\ldots,x_k$ 依次取为本处 $x_0,\\ldots,x_{k-1}$。$P$ 是下式定义的程序，$q,t\\in\\mathbb N$，$\\rho\\in\\mathcal R$。实寄存器编号 $r$ 从 $0$ 开始；$\\rho[i\\leftarrow v]$ 为单点更新。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"m,k\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec\\alpha\\in\\mathcal B^m","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^k","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal I,\\mathcal R","display":false},{"tex":"\\rho_{k,\\vec x}","display":false},{"tex":"x_1,\\ldots,x_k","display":false},{"tex":"x_0,\\ldots,x_{k-1}","display":false},{"tex":"P","display":false},{"tex":"q,t\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\rho\\in\\mathcal R","display":false},{"tex":"r","display":false},{"tex":"0","display":false},{"tex":"\\rho[i\\leftarrow v]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal I_m^{\\mathcal B}:=\\mathcal I\\cup\\{(3,r,i,j):r<m\\land i,j\\in\\mathbb N\\land i\\ne j\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal P_m^{\\mathcal B}:=\\{P\\in(\\mathcal I_m^{\\mathcal B})^{<\\omega}:\\forall q<\\operatorname{lh}(P)\\;\\forall i,n\\in\\mathbb N\\;((P(q)=(1,i,n)\\lor P(q)=(2,n))\\Rightarrow n<\\operatorname{lh}(P))\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\delta_{P,\\vec\\alpha}^{\\mathcal B}(q,\\rho):=\\begin{cases}\n(q,\\rho)&q\\ge\\operatorname{lh}(P),\\\\\n(q+1,\\rho[i\\leftarrow\\rho(i)+1])&q<\\operatorname{lh}(P)\\land P(q)=(0,i),\\\\\n(n,\\rho[i\\leftarrow\\rho(i)-1])&q<\\operatorname{lh}(P)\\land P(q)=(1,i,n)\\land\\rho(i)>0,\\\\\n(q+1,\\rho)&q<\\operatorname{lh}(P)\\land P(q)=(1,i,n)\\land\\rho(i)=0,\\\\\n(n,\\rho)&q<\\operatorname{lh}(P)\\land P(q)=(2,n),\\\\\n(q+1,\\rho[j\\leftarrow\\alpha_r(\\rho(i))])&q<\\operatorname{lh}(P)\\land P(q)=(3,r,i,j).\n\\end{cases}","display":true},{"tex":"C^{\\mathcal B}(P,k,\\vec\\alpha,\\vec x,0):=(0,\\rho_{k,\\vec x}),\\qquad C^{\\mathcal B}(P,k,\\vec\\alpha,\\vec x,t+1):=\\delta_{P,\\vec\\alpha}^{\\mathcal B}(C^{\\mathcal B}(P,k,\\vec\\alpha,\\vec x,t)).","display":true},{"tex":"\\langle3,i,j,r\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"(3,r,i,j)","display":false},{"tex":"m=0","display":false}],"bytes":2554,"backlinks":[{"id":"f3126eb15a4d7bf1","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"f850298d5e806601","anchor":"ref-87","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-df-real-machine]]"},{"id":"be41c4d7dd143cb1","anchor":"ref-70","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-df-real-machine]] — definition"},{"id":"3cb8c24064050ea6","anchor":"ref-43","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"混合元数与层级：[[68-df-baire-space]] → [[68-df-real-machine]] → [[68-df-recursive-real-function]] → [[68-df-analytical-hierarchy]] → [[68-df-projective-hierarchy]] → [[68-thm-separation-theorem]] → [[68-thm-suslin-theorem]]。有限二进制串另记为 $\\mathrm{Bin}_{68}$，见 [[68-df-recursive-tree]]，不与 Baire 空间 $\\mathcal B$ 混用。"}],"outgoing":["4bd688e6777d088c","87b1d4bf7c9d6143","89e092f6450e5227"]}